189 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We're excited to share with you the latest edition of the State of ZK Report for Q4 2023. In this report, we recap what has happened in the ZK ecosystem during the final quarter of the year and highlight the key topics and takeaways. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In Q4, we saw the release of some innovative research, but like much of 2023, the majority of the ecosystem was focused on implementation and engineering. More and more long-standing ZK projects edged towards a new testnet or network release and many of the ZK frameworks became ever more usable. Meanwhile, some novel ZK-powered applications began to see some early and promising adoption. In this report, we dive into ZK for ID, one such application which is starting to see glimmers of real end-user adoption. The products that we will cover here are zPass, Polygon ID, ZK Email, ZKP2P \(which was built on ZK Email\) and ZK Login. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
191 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As an industry, we continue to struggle to find clear metrics on which to gauge & compare ZK proving system. However, this past quarter, researchers from both academia and industry are taking on the challenge and developing frameworks in which to better analyse and compare these projects. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (On the investment front, total volume of venture investment was down, with fewer and smaller ZK raises than previous quarters. Still, developer interest in ZK remains high and growing with more developers joining ZK communities and teams. The quality of the teams joining the ZK space and the sophistication of some of the emerging ZK applications offers us a strong indication that 2024 could be the ZK breakthrough year! )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A bit about us: ZKV is a mission-driven company running validator and node)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (infrastructure on over 10 networks. We were founded in 2019 and our team has strong)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (ties to many of the organizations shaping the ZK industry, such as The Zero Knowledge)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Podcast, ZK Hack, zkSummit, rhino.fi, Geometry Research, and UCL. We have led multiple ZK-focused initiatives including public goods funding, events series and legal education. You can find out more about our work at www.zkvalidator.com.com.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
