/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Github Stars: On January 11th, Aleo's Leo had the highest number of stars on GitHub with 4453. SnarkJS followed with 1590 stars, Cairo with 1305, Circom with 1063, Noir with 725, and o1js with 426. It's worth noting that Leo's leadership has grown significantly since October when it had only 540 stars and was second to last on the list. Note that all the other DSLs have remained in the same ranking as stated since November 2021.)
