/P 427 0 R
/ActualText (In terms of new developer onboarding, Starknet was the leading ZK rollup ecosystem, concluding the year with 1,291 new developers, ranking it in the Top 15 within the general blockchain ecosystem. Within the ZK Rollup field, it was followed by zkSync, Scroll, and Polygon zkEVM in developer growth.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
