/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (zPass integrates ZKPs, specifically zk-SNARKs, to enhance the privacy and programmability of identity verification, using Aleo's infrastructure for security and scalability. Aleo facilitates this through its implementation of ZEXE, enabling encrypted data storage and private transactions while preserving user anonymity. The system adopts a record model inspired by Zcash's UTXO model, which supports complex operations with private inputs and outputs, ensuring data remains encrypted and user-controlled. By decentralizing computation and employing off-chain execution in conjunction with ZKPs, zPass ensures that verification does not compromise data privacy. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
