/ActualText (Succinct launched two important partnerships: one with Avail to develop Vector X and a second one with Celestia named Blobstream. Vector X is a ZK light client designed to secure Avail's data attestation bridge to Ethereum, utilizing zkSNARKs for verifying Avail's GRANDPA consensus. This enables efficient, on-chain light clients that store Avail's data roots and state roots, enhancing Ethereum-settled rollups' access to Avail's data attestations. Similarly, BlobstreamX, created in collaboration with Celestia, relays data commitments to an Ethereum on-chain light client, supporting Ethereum-settled L2s through efficient data verification. Both Vector X and BlobstreamX use ZK proofs to ensure cost-effective and trust-minimized interoperability. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
