/ActualText (Arecibo, a fork of Nova, recently got its first crate released, positioning itself as an incubation project for Nova. It focuses on testing and improving Nova's folding framework, with the introduction of SuperNova, a protocol designed to optimize proof statements and reduce computational complexity. Aimed at rapid evolution, Arecibo offers limited backward compatibility and plays a vital role in supporting the Lurk release. This initiative is a collaborative effort, with significant contributions aimed at enhancing cryptographic proofs and folding schemes, and ultimately contributing back to the Nova project.)
