/ActualText (ZK Hunt by Flynn Calcutt: 0xParc published ZK Hunt, a videogame developed during the 0xPARC 2022 Autonomous Worlds Residency. It is an onchain PvP RTS game using innovative ZK mechanics and information asymmetry. Leveraging the MUD framework and circom for contract architecture and ZK proof generation, the game evolved from a concept of private onchain movement to a platform showcasing diverse cryptographic mechanics, ultimately serving as an educational tool in ZK game development.)
