/ActualText (Aleo Testnet 3 Phase III results: The Aleo Deploy Incentives program during Testnet 3 Phase III concluded with over a thousand submissions, leading to the selection of the top 10 winners sharing a 5M Aleo Credits prize pool. Key learnings from the program included insights on enhancing the Leo programming language and refining Aleo's core protocol, informed by practical feedback and real-world application testing. These learnings are instrumental in guiding Aleo's ongoing development and optimization efforts. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
