/ActualText (Halo2-repl by Axiom: The release of halo2-repl by Axiom, a browser-based REPL for halo2 in JavaScript, aims to simplify the creation of ZK circuits for developers. It eliminates the need to learn new programming languages and manage complex installations, enabling direct in-browser compilation and proof generation of ZK circuits. This tool utilizes WebAssembly bindings for integrating Rust's ZK circuit primitives into a JavaScript environment, fostering easier access and experimentation with ZKPs in blockchain technology.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
