/T (On September 12th, a bug was reported in Aztec Connect's ZK circuit, identified by security researcher lucash-dev via their Immunefi bug bounty program. Aztec quickly responded, disabling vulnerable workflows and patching the system by October 3rd. The bug affected the claim proof in their privacy-focused zkRollup system, allowing sequencer exploitation due to complexities in finite field arithmetic used in ZK circuits, necessitating intricate integer operation solutions. )
/E (On September 12th, a bug was reported in Aztec Connect's ZK circuit, identified by security researcher lucash-dev via their Immunefi bug bounty program. Aztec quickly responded, disabling vulnerable workflows and patching the system by October 3rd. The bug affected the claim proof in their privacy-focused zkRollup system, allowing sequencer exploitation due to complexities in finite field arithmetic used in ZK circuits, necessitating intricate integer operation solutions. )
